 "address_zh": "吉林省松原市前郭尔罗斯蒙古族自治县圣水路与运河东街交叉路口往北约150米",
 "address_en": "About 150 meters north of the intersection of Shengshui Road and Yunhe East Street, Qiangarros Mongolian Autonomous County, Songyuan City, Jilin Province",
